              "expose": [],
              "Layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EOrdering a transcript is quick. If you graduated from a GGUSD high school in the Class of 2015 or later, order through \u003Ca href=\u0022https://ggusd.us/departments/records/transcript\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022 rel=\u0022noopener\u0022\u003Ethe district Parchment page\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003ENeed help ordering? Use the resources below. The two short videos show how to place an order and how to register with a code. The Parchment User Guide covers the full process.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EIf you graduated before 2015, submit your request through the \u003Ca href=\u0022https://ggusd.us/departments/records/request-form\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022 rel=\u0022noopener\u0022\u003EGGUSD Records Department\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
